/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 644 0 R
/T (Weighted Average EM The weighted average equity multiple displays the average EM across all parks sold based on the weight of each park in relation to the total portfolio. For each park, multiply the equity invested by its perspective gross or net EM. Then add these numbers together and divide by the total portfolios equity invested. Using a gross EM will give you the weighted average at the property level. Net EM will provide you with a weighted average at the investor level.)
/E (Weighted Average EM The weighted average equity multiple displays the average EM across all parks sold based on the weight of each park in relation to the total portfolio. For each park, multiply the equity invested by its perspective gross or net EM. Then add these numbers together and divide by the total portfolios equity invested. Using a gross EM will give you the weighted average at the property level. Net EM will provide you with a weighted average at the investor level.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [6]
>>
